  "abstract": "Run MLflow as a self-hosted LLM tracing backend. Covers pip, Docker, Compose and Helm installs, PostgreSQL and artifact stores, Host validation and basic auth, OTLP ingest at /v1/traces and the autolog SDK, LiteLLM, vLLM and OpenAI-compatible endpoints, masking, archival and deletion, upgrades with schema migration, and troubleshooting, with a Compose template and a read-only check script.",
